om you. Nobody arrives with all of it, and we'll help you grow into the rest.</p><h3></h3><p><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul><li>CircleCI or a similar CI tool</li><li>Working with an external testing partner</li><li>Payments, checkout or ticketing systems</li><li>Testing apps used at live events, with poor networks</li><li>Test management tools such as Qase or TestRail</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>What we offer you</strong></p><ul><li>Generous annual leave policies aimed at promoting work-life balance.</li><li>Matched pension, or 401k for US staff.</li><li>Comprehensive staff wellbeing initiatives, featuring regular activities and workplace programmes to support mental and physical health. This includes discounted ClassPass memberships and custom-fitted earplugs.</li><li>Company-led social events, team lunches, and discounts on merch.</li><li>Paid annual volunteering allowance, encouraging contributions to community projects and charities you care about.</li><li>A transparent internal company culture committed to diversity, equity, and inclusion (see: <a href="https://ra.co/about/diversity" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external">https://ra.co/about/diversity</a>).</li><li>Active involvement in community projects within the electronic music community (see: <a href="https://ra.co/about/community" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external">https://ra.co/about/community</a>).</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>More about RA</strong></p><p>We are independent and we intend to stay that way. 25 years in, RA answers to the culture it came from rather than to outside stakeholders. That is what enables us to make decisions on a long-term basis.</p><p>Our staff, contributors and international teams are not observers. They are part of the scenes we cover, and that is what we hire for. Craft first, and then a genuine stake in this music rather than just a job in it.</p><p>RA has been B Corp certified since 2024, which holds us to standards on social and environm