e of outbound calls and follow-ups so good candidates never go cold</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cover evening and weekend shifts to keep response times fast</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keep candidate information accurate and up to date in Personio</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Share feedback with the Head of People to improve call scripts and results<br /></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ideal Candidate</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Native or near-native German (essential)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent spoken and written English (essential)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Based in Berlin with the right to work in Germany, able to work hybrid from the office</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Available for evenings and weekends as a regular part of the schedule</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Some experience in a people-facing role such as sales, customer service, hospitality, retail or call centre work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confident on the phone and quick to build rapport with all kinds of people</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Resilient and upbeat, staying motivated across high call volumes and the occasional “not interested”</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Organised and reliable, keeping track of many conversations without letting anything slip</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to Have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Previous experience in recruiting or talent acquisition</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with Personio or a similar HR system or CRM</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Tools &amp; Stack</strong><br />Personio, phone and video calling tools<br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Join Our Team</strong> Be part of a collaborative,