:"Rosenheim","created_at":1792178411},{"slug":"working-student-piping-system-propulsion-parsdorf-bavaria-406311","company_name":"isaraerospace","title":"Working Student – Piping System, Propulsion (m/f/d)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Mission Brief&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
