tems to understand how they work.&lt;br&gt;· Your growth and impact trajectory demonstrates that you have mastered gathering and iterating on feedback from your engineering and cross-functional peers.&lt;br&gt;· You have strong verbal and written communication skills that support effective collaboration with our global engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
