&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/klaviyo/large-enterprise-account-executive-london-225432","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1792216517},{"slug":"ux-product-designer-south-east-hampshire-174993","company_name":"Archer56","title":"UX Product Designer","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Silicon Valley, California, Archer is a leader in the next-gen aerospace sector building an end-to-end advanced air mobility platform that delivers air taxis, unmanned aircraft systems (“UAS”), aviation-related physical artificial intelligence (“AI”) solutions, and other technologies to customers worldwide across the commercial aerospace and defense sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our sights are set high and our problems are hard, and we believe that diversity in the workplace is what makes us smarter, drives better insights, and will ultimately lift us all to success. We are dedicated to cultivating an equitable and inclusive environment that embraces our differences, and supports and celebrates all of our team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Archer is best known for Midnight, our electric air taxi. This role isn&#39;t on that program. The AI Products Org is building consumer software for people who love to fly: mobile apps, websites, and web apps for flyers, flight enthusiasts, and pilots. We haven&#39;t announced what we&#39;re building, and we&#39;re not going to spoil it in a job posting. What we can tell you: it&#39;s a consumer app with a large user base, and the design decisions made in the next year will define the next chapter of growth for the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s why we&#39;re hiring a UX Product Designer; specifically, someone who has shipped consumer apps that real people download, rate, and decide to keep or delete, and who can take a loosely defined problem and come back with something worth building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end product design for consumer aviation apps on iOS and Android, along with the websites and web apps that support them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for a wide range of users, from casual flyers and aviation enthusiasts to working pilots who need information that&#39;s fast, accurate, and trustworthy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run product explorations: sketch out directions, pressure-test them with users and the team, and kill the weak ones early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll get context and constraints from Design Leadership, PM and engineering, but the design leadership on your projects is yours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship to the App Store and Google Play, then keep refining based on how people actually use what you shipped: analytics, experiments, reviews, and user research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar on craft across the org, through your own work and through feedback on everyone else&#39;s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product design experience minimum.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shipping features for consumer mobile apps on the App Store and Google Play, ideally at a startup, a big tech company, or both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Products you&#39;ve designed that are live and in users&#39; hands. We will ask about them, in detail: what you decided, what you got wrong, what you&#39;d change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in native iOS and Android design (Human Interface Guidelines, Material Design) and strong systems thinking across mobile and web. You know when a pattern should be shared across platforms and when it shouldn&#39;t&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using data to shape design decisions, from engagement and retention metrics to App Store feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity. If you need a fully scoped ticket before you can start, this won&#39;t be a fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio that shows your thinking, not just polished final screens&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a pilot, student pilot, plane spotter, or all-around aviation nerd. You&#39;d be designing for people like you, and that matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing consumer apps built around real-time data, maps, or location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience growing a consumer app: onboarding, retention, subscriptions, or monetization, social posting and marketing collateral&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside AI/ML teams, or designing products with AI-driven features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve shipped consumer products in a domain with real-world constraints (regulated industries, safety-adjacent, hardware-adjacent) and know how that shapes design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI Products is a roughly 100-person software org inside a company of aerospace engineers, and we expect to grow substantially over the next year. You get the resources and momentum of a real org, but the product development startup culture of a smaller team based in the UK – building for an audience that genuinely cares about flying.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to hear more about what we&#39;re building before you apply, you can&#39;t. Apply, and we&#39;ll tell you plenty.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Archer is committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to job applicants with physical or mental disabilities, and those with sincerely held religious beliefs. Applicants who may require reasonable accommodation for any part of the application or hiring process should provide their name and contact information to Archer’s People Team at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Reasonable accommodations will be determined on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Information collected and processed as part of any job applications you choose to submit is subject to Archer&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://archer.com/legal/personnel-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Certain positions may be eligible for visa sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Archer is proud to be an Equal Opportunity employer committed to diversity and inclusivity in the workplace. All aspects of employment are decided on the basis of merit, qualifications, and business needs. We do not discriminate based upon race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, age, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status, gender identity or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Archer Aviation does not engage with external recruiting agencies/individual recruiters with whom it does not have a prior written agreement. Archer reserves the right to make use of any unsolicited resumes that it receives and bears no responsibility for payment of any fees asserted from the use of unsolicited resumes. If you are a recruiting agency or individual recruiter wishing to do business with Archer, please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- All employment processes are managed by the Archer People Team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/archer56/ux-product-designer-south-east-hampshire-174993","tags":["Design Advanced & Production"],"job_types":[],"location":"South East Hampshire","created_at":1792216517},{"slug":"lead-bid-manager-uki-public-sector-technology-london-248648","company_name":"Axon","title":"Lead Bid Manager, UK&I (Public Sector technology)","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Bid Manager, UK &amp;amp; Ireland&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Bid Manager, you will lead Axon’s most complex and highest-impact RFP and tender responses, proposals, and other customer-facing selling documents across the UK and Ireland. You’ll be a member of a global team that supports Axon sales worldwide and will serve as the senior proposal execution lead for the region. You will own proposal development from early procurement engagement through submission and evaluation-period follow-up, translating established win strategy into a controlled response plan and ensuring the final submission is compliant, responsive, scorable, customer-focused, and on time. Your strengths in judgment under ambiguity, cross-functional leadership, technical and proposal writing, and compliance discipline will be central to success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Focused primarily on UK and Ireland public-sector opportunities, you will work closely with Sales, Bid Strategy, Solutions Engineering, Product, Legal, Security, Pricing, Finance, Services, and executive stakeholders. You will personally lead the hardest pursuits while also strengthening regional proposal readiness, reusable standards, coaching, and execution across bids owned by other Proposal Managers. This is an office-based position in the United Kingdom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; hybrid schedule of Monday working remotely, and Tue-Fri in our London office&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director, Global Proposals&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports:&lt;/strong&gt; N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, the Lead Proposal Manager is the senior owner of proposal execution for the region’s most complex pursuits. You will engage early in the procurement process, establish how the response will be run, make execution and compliance decisions within approved boundaries, and carry the proposal through submission and evaluation-period deliverables. This is a comprehensive individual-contributor role requiring expertise in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proposal Planning &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate established win strategy into an executable response architecture, including workstreams, assignments, proof collection, review cadence, decision gates, and submission-readiness criteria. Build pre-bid readiness for anticipated strategic procurements with Sales and Bid Strategy. Drive resolution of product exceptions, compliance issues, and proposal commitments through the appropriate approval paths, while partnering with Sales, Bid Strategy, Pricing, and leadership on commercial, account-strategy, and bid decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead large cross-functional teams across Sales, Solutions Engineering, Product, Legal, Security, Pricing, Finance, Services, Proposal Team members, and executive stakeholders. Drive decisions, close gaps, enforce deadlines, adjudicate conflicting review input, and coach Proposal Managers and Specialists to improve execution judgment, compliance discipline, and independent ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Compliance Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Own proposal governance, milestones, compliance traceability, mandatory requirements, forms, schedules, portals, review cycles, final packaging, and submission readiness. Identify and manage disqualification and responsiveness risks, and preserve proposal context through structured handoff of assumptions, exceptions, commitments, and unresolved risks during clarification, presentation, and other evaluation-period activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proposal Writing &amp;amp; Solution Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop technical and solution fluency to challenge weak claims, identify risk, and frame partial or non-compliant requirements carefully. Write, edit, and integrate high-value content when SME inputs are incomplete, inconsistent, overly technical, or insufficiently responsive, producing a coherent response for technical and non-technical evaluators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Leadership &amp;amp; Stakeholder Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong operating relationships with UK and Ireland Sales and technical leaders, monitor regional delivery health, identify where pursuits need additional support or escalation, and provide Proposal Leadership with recommendations on complex-pursuit routing and resourcing. Identify repeatable success and failure patterns and improve regional execution through reusable standards, tools, proof sources, training, and workflow changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What You Bring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically 8+ years of proposal, bid, tender, or comparable pursuit experience, including repeated end-to-end ownership of large, ambiguous, high-stakes submissions with significant cross-functional stakeholder load and formal review cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong UK public-sector tender experience, including procurement routes, evaluation structures, frameworks and call-offs, mandatory requirements, submission mechanics, and evaluator expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with major policing, blue-light/public safety, central government, defence/security, justice, or complex public-sector technology procurements is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading responses with strict compliance, controlled submission, and potential disqualification or non-responsive risk, with sound judgment about execution tradeoffs, prioritization of competing risks and deadlines, and when Product, Legal, Pricing, or strategy approval is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent proposal writing and editing skills, combined with the technical learning agility to challenge claims, identify solution risk, and turn uneven or highly technical inputs into clear, evaluator-focused, defensible content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence senior stakeholders without direct authority, handle constructive conflict, and escalate with clear options and a recommended path.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to improve proposal execution beyond personally owned bids through standards, tools, processes, training, proof sources, or other reusable practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to coach Proposal Managers or other proposal practitioners and improve their independent execution quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with Microsoft 365 and SharePoint, Salesforce or comparable CRM, proposal-management platforms such as QorusDocs, Responsive/RFPIO, or Qvidian, and AI-enabled workflow tools. Formal proposal-development training or exposure to Shipley, APMP, Sant, or equivalent is preferred; strong tool judgment and learning agility matter more than experience with any one platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits that Benefit You&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and UK retirement benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance and health cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous insurance coverages (disability, long-term sick etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellbeing benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office amenities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;...and many more.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and eligibility are governed by Axon&#39;s applicable UK plans and policies and may vary based on the nature of your employment and work location.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some roles may also require legal eligibility to work in a firearms environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We collect personal information from applicants to evaluate candidates for employment. You may request access, deletion, or exercise other CCPA rights at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Axon Privacy Web Form&lt;/a&gt;. For more information, please see the Your California Privacy Rights section of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Axon’s mission is to Protect Life and is committed to the well-being and safety of its employees as well as Axon’s impact on the environment. All Axon employees must be aware of and committed to the appropriate environmental, health, and safety regulations, policies, and procedures. Axon employees are empowered to report safety concerns as they arise and activities potentially impacting the environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
