anges to service delivery and supporting the Head of Commercial Account Management to implement any agreed changes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as a point of escalation for serious or complicated complaints, to include safeguarding concerns, flagging and escalating this as necessary.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Review any feedback from corporate account holders to ensure that any concerns are resolved efficiently and politely, and in accordance with any regulatory obligations (e.g., licensing, GDPR etc.).</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Service Delivery</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monitor Veezu’s performance against customer-specific SLA’s and KPIs, ensuring consistent service excellence.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Liaise with Regional JBC Managers and Regional Operation Manager to ensure excellent customer service delivery is always achieved.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify corporate account customers, who’s bookings are made manually with a keen focus to move to an automated offering wherever possible.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Embrace the introduction of any new technologies or corporate account interaction and work to ensure its successful implementation within the Region.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Liaise with Regional Management in the Journey Booking Centre and Veezu Drive to provide useful feedback on the account service level fulfilments with the aim of improving customer service delivery.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with other Commercial Account Managers to share best practices.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Integration</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Liaise as a first point of contact for all new business, working closely with regional BDM’s and Head of Commercial 