<p><span style="font-size: 16px; color: #7e8c8d;">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><div><br></div><p>Join us as a <strong>People Data Analyst</strong> to help Qonto’s People team turn HR data into clear insights and better-informed decisions.</p>
<p>Reporting to Mélodie Moulin, you will work closely with your People Systems teammates, HRBPs, and partners across People and Finance. You’ll combine hands-on analysis with an understanding of HR topics to answer practical questions, improve dashboards and reporting, and help stakeholders make better use of People data.</p>
<h2>➡️ What you’ll do</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Turn People data into actionable insights.</strong> Explore topics such as turnover, absenteeism, and performance, investigate trends, and communicate findings through clear analyses and concise recommendations.</li>
