<li><strong>Room to improve how work gets done</strong>, through clearer dashboards, reusable analyses, better documentation, and practical applications of AI.</li>
</ul>
<h2>➡️ Your future manager</h2>
<p>You’ll report to <strong>Mélodie Moulin, Head of People Systems at Qonto</strong>.</p>
