nance, retraining, and continuous improvement.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">Why Join Us?</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p>Join one of Europe’s most promising deep-tech scale-ups.</p></li><li><p>Shape the future of a rapidly growing multidisciplinary R&amp;D organization.</p></li><li><p>Competitive salary and benefits package.</p></li><li><p>Enjoy regular team activities and company events.</p></li><li><p>Fresh team lunches provided 3 times/week.</p></li></ul> <br> <h4>Requirements:</h4><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW171025757 BCX8">Strong professional experience with Python and commonly used scientific and data-science libraries (e.g., pandas, NumPy, SciPy, scikit-learn).</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW171025757 BCX8">Strong foundation in statistical analysis, algorithm development, machine learning, and data modelling.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW171025757 BCX8">Practical experience analysing sensor signals and time-series data.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW171025757 BCX8">Solid understanding of signal-processing techniques such as filtering, denoising, spectral analysis, Fourier or wavelet transforms, and dimensionality reduction.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW171025757 BCX8">Experience developing, validating, and deploying machine-learning models in production or cloud environments.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW171025757 BCX8">Ability to connect patterns in data with physical processes and real-world system behaviour.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW171025757 BCX8">Experience with at least one deep-learning framework, such as PyTorch, TensorFlow, or JAX.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW171025757 BCX8">Ability to write clear, modular, tested, and maintainable Python code.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW171025757 BCX8">Experience contributing to end-to-end data-science or ML projects, from problem framing and experimentation to deployment and monitoring.</p></li></ul><h4>Qualifications:</h4><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW76713326 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW76713326 BCX8">You have at least 3 years of professional experience in data science with a focus on sensor data analysis.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW76713326 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW76713326 BCX8">Familiarity with real-time systems, edge computing, or predictive maintenance solutions is a plus.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW76713326 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW76713326 BCX8"><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="http://M.Sc">M.Sc</a>. or Ph.D. degree in a relevant discipline in science or engineering.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW76713326 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW76713326 BCX8">Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW76713326 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW76713326 BCX8">Solid understanding of mathematics and physics, with the ability to apply theory to real engineering problems.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW76713326 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW76713326 BCX8">A pragmatic, hands-on mindset and willingness to work with imperfect real-world data.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW76713326 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW76713326 BCX8">You have strong verbal and written communication skills in English (Dutch is an advantage).</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW76713326 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW76713326 BCX8">Ability to work independently, take ownership, and collaborate effectively across disciplines.</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW265304193 BCX8"><strong><em>Nice to Have:</em></strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW265304193 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW265304193 BCX8">Experience with partial-discharge, acoustic, vibration, electrical, or other condition-monitoring data.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW265304193 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW265304193 BCX8">Experience with predictive maintenance, anomaly detection, fault diagnosis, or remaining-useful-life estimation.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW265304193 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW265304193 BCX8">Knowledge of time-series and general-purpose databases such as QuestDB, MongoDB, or PostgreSQL.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW265304193 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW265304193 BCX8">Experience with experiment tracking, dataset or model versioning, and reproducible ML workflows.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW265304193 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW265304193 BCX8">Experience with GPU computing, CUDA, model optimization, or real-time edge deployment.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW265304193 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW265304193 BCX8">Familiarity with MLOps practices, automated testing, CI/CD, and production model monitoring.</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW236113144 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW236113144 BCX8"><strong>Security &amp; Compliance:</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW236113144 BCX8">You'll be working with clients in the defense and security sectors, obtaining a Certificate of No Objection issued by the AIVD (Dutch General Intelligence and Security Service) is mandatory. This means you will need to undergo a security screening. For more information, please refer to details on security screening.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/optics11/partial-discharge-data-scientist-amsterdam-32702","tags":["R&D"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792009953},{"slug":"software-test-engineer-amsterdam-332708","company_name":"Optics11","title":"Software Test Engineer","description":"<p class="Paragraph SCXW75090954 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">We are looking for a hands-on <strong>Software Test Engineer</strong> to ensure the quality and reliability of software solutions used in real-world sensing and data processing systems.&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW75090954 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">Optics11 is a deep-tech company developing advanced fiber-optic sensing technologies for challenging environments and applications in energy and underwater security. Our systems enable high-performance sensing and monitoring through advanced photonics, signal processing, and data-driven intelligence.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW138383326 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">We are expanding our R&amp;D team with a Software Test Engineer who is passionate about quality, structured validation, and delivering robust software in complex engineering environments.&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW17873096 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW17873096 BCX8">As a Software Test Engineer, you will be responsible for defining and executing practical software tests to validate software components (including algorithms, cloud back-end, and user interfaces) that process sensor signals generated by fiber-optic sensing systems. You will work closely with data scientists, signal processing specialists, back-end developers, and software architects to ensure that products meet functional and non-functional requirements.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW17873096 BCX8">This role requires a hands-on professional with a proactive mindset, a structured approach to software testing, strong attention to detail, and the ability to understand complex technical systems and translate requirements into effective test strategies.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW57822337 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></h4><ul><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Perform functional, integration, regression, system, and end-to-end testing across edge devices, cloud services, APIs, databases, and graphical user interfaces.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Define test strategies, test plans, test cases, acceptance criteria, and automated test scripts for an edge and cloud software platforms.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Identify, document, and track software defects, ensuring clear reproduction steps and proper follow-up.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Collaborate with product owners, developers and engineers to understand system requirements and ensure test coverage.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Contribute to the development and maintenance of automated test frameworks and pipelines.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Test edge–cloud behaviour under interrupted connectivity, delayed or duplicated messages, device restarts, software updates, and synchronization failures.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Validate software performance, reliability, and stability under different operating conditions.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Support testing of software running on edge hardware, including hardware–software integration in laboratory and field environments.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Analyse test results and provide clear, actionable feedback to development teams.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Ensure traceability between requirements, test cases, and test results.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Integrate automated tests into GitLab CI/CD pipelines and help define appropriate quality gates.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Contribute to continuous improvement of testing processes, tools, and quality standards.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Participate in release readiness reviews and ensure software meets quality benchmarks before deployment.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>Join one of Europe’s most promising deep-tech scale-ups.</p></li><li><p>Shape the future of a rapidly growing multidisciplinary R&amp;D organization.</p></li><li><p>Competitive salary and benefits package.</p></li><li><p>Enjoy regular team activities and company events.</p></li><li><p>Fresh team lunches provided 3 times/week.</p></li></ul> <br> <h4>Requirements:</h4><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Technical skills</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Familiarity with test management and bug tracking tools (e.g., Jira, TestRail).</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Programming or scripting skills (e.g., Python, C++, Javascript or similar).</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Experience developing automated tests using tools such as Pytest, Playwright, Cypress, Selenium, or comparable frameworks.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Experience testing web-based graphical user interfaces.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Experience testing REST APIs, back-end services, or distributed software components.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Experience with Docker, AWS, Gitlab , Linux and CI/CD pipelines.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Ability to design structured, maintainable, and reproducible automated tests.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Familiarity with behaviour-driven development and Gherkin specifications.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>Qualifications:</h4><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW76713326 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">A degree in computer science, software engineering, embedded systems, or a related technical discipline or equivalent practical experience.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Proven experience in software testing or quality assurance.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Strong understanding of software testing methodologies and lifecycle.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Experience with both exploratory/manual testing and automated testing.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Experience testing integrated systems rather than only isolated software components.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Proactive in identifying risks and gaps in requirements and investigating failures across multiple system components.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Pragmatic and hands-on when working with hardware, software, test environments, and imperfect real-world data.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Able to work independently while collaborating closely with different engineering disciplines.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Able to communicate technical problems and quality risks clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW265304193 BCX8"><strong><em>Nice to Have:</em></strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW265304193 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW72397721 BCX8">Experience with AWS or another cloud platform.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW72397721 BCX8">Experience testing data-driven or signal-processing systems.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW72397721 BCX8">Knowledge of embedded systems and hardware–software integration.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW72397721 BCX8">Experience testing unreliable-network, offline, reconnection, synchronization, and recovery scenarios.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW72397721 BCX8">Experience in high-tech, industrial, or defense-related environments.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW72397721 BCX8">Experience with LabVIEW</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW265304193 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW236113144 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW236113144 BCX8"><strong>Security &amp; Compliance:</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW236113144 BCX8">You'll be working with clients in the defense and security sectors, obtaining a Certificate of No Objection issued by the AIVD (Dutch General Intelligence and Security Service) is mandatory. This means you will need to undergo a security screening. For more information, please refer to details on security screening.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/optics11/software-test-engineer-amsterdam-332708","tags":["R&D"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792009953},{"slug":"senior-embedded-software-engineer-amsterdam-240852","company_name":"Optics11","title":"Senior Embedded Software Engineer","description":"<p class="Paragraph SCXW108545368 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">As a<strong> Senior Embedded Software Engineer</strong> at Optics11, you are responsible for the development and engineering realization of embedded software solutions throughout the product development lifecycle. You translate allocated product and subsystem requirements into robust software solutions that deliver reliable system functionality while supporting maintainability, testability, scalability, product integration, and long-term product reliability.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW108545368 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;">The embedded software subsystem comprises the software running on our sensing interrogator platforms, including <strong>e</strong>mbedded Linux applications, hardware interfaces, internal APIs, system control, calibration functionality, diagnostics, data acquisition interfaces, and supporting software infrastructure. You apply specialist embedded software expertise to develop, improve, and mature subsystem solutions that contribute to successful product realization as part of multidisciplinary engineering teams.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW108545368 BCX8" style="text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#5a5f72">You work closely with Architects, Photonics, Electronics, FPGA development, Product Integration, Verification &amp; Validation, Lifecycle Engineering, application/software teams, manufacturing, and other subsystem development teams to ensure embedded software solutions are successfully developed and realized as part of the overall product.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>Key Responsibilities:</h4><ul><li><p>Develop and maintain embedded software solutions throughout the product development lifecycle.</p></li><li><p>Translate product and subsystem requirements into reliable, maintainable, testable, and scalable software designs.</p></li><li><p>Design, develop, and integrate embedded Linux applications, hardware interfaces, internal APIs, system control, calibration, diagnostics, and related software components.</p></li><li><p>Take ownership of significant software workstreams and mature existing software stacks into reliable product-level solutions.</p></li><li><p>Develop and maintain software testing, automation, CI/CD, diagnostics, and repeatable release processes.</p></li><li><p>Support prototype development, system integration, verification, qualification, industrialization, and product release.</p></li><li><p>Analyze system and software performance and troubleshoot complex issues across software, electronics, FPGA, photonics, and system interfaces.</p></li><li><p>Identify technical risks, evaluate design alternatives, and contribute to architecture, design, and code reviews.</p></li><li><p>Ensure software quality, reliability, security, and suitability for manufacturing, deployment, and long-term product support.</p></li><li><p>Plan and deliver assigned work against agreed priorities and milestones, proactively communicating risks, dependencies, and technical debt.</p></li><li><p>Collaborate across multidisciplinary engineering teams and provide technical guidance within your area of expertise.</p></li><li><p>Share knowledge, lessons learned, and software best practices to strengthen team capability and continuously improve engineering ways of working.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="font-size:1.2em">Why Join Us?</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p>Join one of Europe’s most promising deep-tech scale-ups.</p></li><li><p>Shape the future of a rapidly growing multidisciplinary R&amp;D organization.</p></li><li><p>Competitive salary and benefits package.</p></li><li><p>Enjoy regular team activities and company events.</p></li><li><p>Fresh team lunches provided every day.</p></li></ul> <br> <h4><strong>Qualifications:</strong></h4><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">BSc or MSc in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Embedded Systems, or related technical discipline.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">5+ years of relevant experience in embedded Linux software development (userspace and/or BSP).</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Strong experience developing software for embedded products throughout the product development lifecycle.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Strong C++ and/or Python development skills for Linux userspace applications and services.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Strong understanding of embedded Linux, Linux application development, and hardware/software interaction.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Experience with software architecture, interfaces, APIs, multithreading, inter-process communication, and hardware abstraction.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Experience building and maintaining embedded Linux BSPs and images using PetaLinux, Yocto, or similar.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Ability to debug and patch existing Linux kernel drivers, device tree, and boot/integration issues.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Experience with Git, CMake, unit testing, code reviews, and modern software development practices.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Experience developing automated tests and contributing to CI/CD environments; familiarity with Docker in embedded development.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Experience with Python for automation, testing, analysis, or tooling.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Strong analytical skills and experience applying structured problem-solving and root-cause analysis methods.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Experience debugging complex issues across software and hardware boundaries.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Strong communication skills in English and a collaborative working style.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Eligible for required EU/NATO/security screening or clearance, where applicable to the role.</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>Nice to have:</strong></h4><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Experience with Xilinx Zynq UltraScale+, heterogeneous SoCs, or comparable embedded Linux platforms.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Experience interfacing Linux software with FPGA-based systems.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Experience with real-time or high-throughput data acquisition and signal-processing systems.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">Hands-on Linux kernel work beyond fixes.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221221344 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221221344 BCX8">